{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">TERMINAL function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310813","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/TERMINAL-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/TERMINAL-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"TERMINAL-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">TERMINAL function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">In Windows, in graphical interfaces, TERMINAL returns\nWIN3. In Windows, in character interfaces, TERMINAL returns CO80, BW80,\nor MONO, depending on the monitor type. On UNIX, TERMINAL returns\nthe value of the $TERM environment variable. In batch mode, TERMINAL\nreturns a null string.</p>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> Does not apply to\nSpeedScript programming.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"TERMINAL-function__syntax_GC1B1AX2704953\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d220042e99\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"TERMINAL-function__idGDP3032677334\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>TERMINAL</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"TERMINAL-function__example_GC1B1AY2704957\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d220042e125\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\none-line procedure displays the type of terminal you are using:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-term.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"TERMINAL-function__idGDP3042677338\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>MESSAGE &quot;You are currently using a&quot; <strong class=\"ph b\">TERMINAL &quot;terminal</strong>.&quot;.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"TERMINAL-function__see-also_GC1B1B02704963\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d220042e163\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TERMINAL-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TERMINAL-statement.html\">TERMINAL statement</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TENANT-NAME-TO-ID-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TENANT-NAME-TO-ID-function.html\">TENANT-NAME-TO-ID function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TERMINAL-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TERMINAL-statement.html\">TERMINAL statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310813","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"TERMINAL function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TERMINAL-function.html","type":"Manual"}